{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e1", "type": "leave", "agent": "mr_dursley", "patient": null, "location": "number_four", "source_text": "Mr. Dursley picked up his briefcase, pecked Mrs. Dursley on the cheek, and tried to kiss Dudley good-bye but missed."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e2", "type": "discover", "agent": "mr_dursley", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "It was on the corner of the street that he noticed the first sign of something peculiar \u2014 a cat reading a map."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e3", "type": "arrive", "agent": "mr_dursley", "patient": null, "location": "grunnings", "source_text": "Mr. Dursley arrived in the Grunnings parking lot, his mind back on drills."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e4", "type": "talk", "agent": "mr_dursley", "patient": null, "location": "grunnings", "source_text": "He yelled at five different people."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e5", "type": "discover", "agent": "mr_dursley", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "The cat was still there. It was staring down Privet Drive as though it were waiting for something."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e6", "type": "arrive", "agent": "albus_dumbledore", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "A man appeared on the corner the cat had been watching, appeared so suddenly and silently you\u2019d have thought he\u2019d just popped out of the ground."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e7", "type": "talk", "agent": "albus_dumbledore", "patient": "professor_mcgonagall", "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "Fancy seeing you here, Professor McGonagall."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e8", "type": "arrive", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "A huge motorcycle fell out of the air and landed on the road in front of them."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e9", "type": "give", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "In his vast, muscular arms he was holding a bundle of blankets."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e10", "type": "leave", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "Hagrid swung himself onto the motorcycle and kicked the engine into life; with a roar it rose into the air and off into the night."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e11", "type": "leave", "agent": "albus_dumbledore", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "He turned on his heel and with a swish of his cloak, he was gone."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e12", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "cupboard", "source_text": "\u201cUp! Get up! Now!\u201d"}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e13", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "cupboard", "source_text": "\u201cAre you up yet?\u201d she demanded."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e14", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\u201cWell, get a move on, I want you to look after the bacon."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e15", "type": "talk", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\u201cComb your hair!\u201d he barked."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e16", "type": "talk", "agent": "dudley_dursley", "patient": "aunt_petunia", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\u201cThirty-six,\u201d he said, looking up at his mother and father."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e17", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "dudley_dursley", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\u201cAnd we\u2019ll buy you another two presents while we\u2019re out today."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e18", "type": "talk", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "aunt_petunia", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\u201cWe could phone Marge,\u201d Uncle Vernon suggested."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e19", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "uncle_vernon", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\u201cDon\u2019t be silly, Vernon, she hates the boy.\u201d"}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e20", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "aunt_petunia", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\u201cYou could just leave me here,\u201d Harry put in hopefully."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e21", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\u201cAnd come back and find the house in ruins?\u201d she snarled."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e22", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "uncle_vernon", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\u201cI suppose we could take him to the zoo,\u201d said Aunt Petunia slowly."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e23", "type": "talk", "agent": "dudley_dursley", "patient": "aunt_petunia", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\u201cI\u2026 don\u2019t\u2026 want\u2026 him\u2026 t-t-to come!\u201d Dudley yelled."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e24", "type": "arrive", "agent": "piers_polkiss", "patient": null, "location": "dursleys_house", "source_text": "Piers Polkiss, walked in with his mother."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e25", "type": "leave", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "dursleys_house", "source_text": "Half an hour later, Harry... was sitting in the back of the Dursleys\u2019 car."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e26", "type": "talk", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "dursleys_house", "source_text": "\u201cI\u2019m warning you now, boy \u2014 any funny business, anything at all \u2014 and you\u2019ll be in that cupboard from now until Christmas.\u201d"}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e27", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "zoo", "source_text": "It was a very sunny Saturday and the zoo was crowded with families."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e28", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "boa_constrictor", "location": "reptile_house", "source_text": "The snake suddenly opened its beady eyes."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e29", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "boa_constrictor", "location": "reptile_house", "source_text": "\u201cWhere do you come from, anyway?\u201d Harry asked."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e30", "type": "escape", "agent": "boa_constrictor", "patient": null, "location": "reptile_house", "source_text": "The great snake was uncoiling itself rapidly, slithering out onto the floor."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e31", "type": "talk", "agent": "piers_polkiss", "patient": "uncle_vernon", "location": "dursleys_house", "source_text": "\u201cHarry was talking to it, weren\u2019t you, Harry?\u201d"}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e32", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "letter", "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "a letter for Harry."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e33", "type": "take", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "letter", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "it was jerked sharply out of his hand by Uncle Vernon."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e34", "type": "talk", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "aunt_petunia", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "P-P-Petunia!"}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e35", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "uncle_vernon", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "Vernon! Oh my goodness \u2014 Vernon!"}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e36", "type": "leave", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "We\u2019re going away."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e37", "type": "arrive", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": null, "location": "railview_hotel", "source_text": "Uncle Vernon stopped at last outside a gloomy-looking hotel."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e38", "type": "arrive", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": null, "location": "shack", "source_text": "Perched on top of the rock was the most miserable little shack you could imagine."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e39", "type": "arrive", "agent": "rubeus_hagrid", "patient": null, "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "A giant of a man was standing in the doorway."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e40", "type": "talk", "agent": "rubeus_hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "An\u2019 here\u2019s Harry!"}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e41", "type": "give", "agent": "rubeus_hagrid", "patient": "birthday_cake", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "Got summat fer yeh here \u2014 I mighta sat on it at some point, but it\u2019ll taste all right."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e42", "type": "talk", "agent": "rubeus_hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "Harry \u2014 yet a wizard."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e43", "type": "give", "agent": "rubeus_hagrid", "patient": "letter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "An\u2019 I reckon it\u2019s abou\u2019 time yeh read yer letter."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e44", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "Knew! Of course we knew!"}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e45", "type": "attack", "agent": "rubeus_hagrid", "patient": "dudley_dursley", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "there was a flash of violet light, a sound like a firecracker, a sharp squeal"}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e46", "type": "talk", "agent": "rubeus_hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "Harry Potter, not a wizard \u2014 you wait, you\u2019ll be right famous at Hogwarts."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e47", "type": "think", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "hut", "source_text": "It was a dream, he told himself firmly."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e48", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "owl", "location": "hut", "source_text": "There was an owl rapping its claw on the window."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e49", "type": "give", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "wizard_coins", "location": "hut", "source_text": "Give him five Knuts, said Hagrid sleepily."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e50", "type": "leave", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": null, "location": "hut", "source_text": "Best be Off, Harry, lots ter do today."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e51", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "gringotts", "source_text": "Gringotts, said Hagrid."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e52", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "wizard_coins", "location": "gringotts", "source_text": "Inside were mounds of gold coins."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e53", "type": "take", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "letter", "location": "gringotts", "source_text": "Hagrid picked it up and tucked it deep inside his coat."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e54", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "leaky_cauldron", "source_text": "Welcome back, Mr. Potter, welcome back."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e55", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "professor_quirrell", "location": "leaky_cauldron", "source_text": "Professor Quirrell will be one of your teachers at Hogwarts."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e56", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "diagon_alley", "source_text": "Welcome, said Hagrid, to Diagon Alley."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e57", "type": "give", "agent": "mr_ollivander", "patient": "wand", "location": "diagon_alley", "source_text": "The wand chooses the wizard, remember."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e58", "type": "leave", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "diagon_alley", "source_text": "The late afternoon sun hung low in the sky as Harry and Hagrid made their way back down Diagon Alley."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e59", "type": "farewell", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "train", "source_text": "See yeh soon, Harry."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e60", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "uncle_vernon", "location": "living_room", "source_text": "\u201cEr \u2014 Uncle Vernon?\u201d"}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e61", "type": "talk", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "living_room", "source_text": "\u201cFunny way to get to a wizards\u2019 school, the train."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e62", "type": "leave", "agent": "dudley_dursley", "patient": null, "location": "living_room", "source_text": "Dudley screamed and ran from the room."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e63", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "kings_cross_station", "source_text": "They reached King\u2019s Cross at half past ten."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e64", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "platform_nine_and_three_quarters", "location": "kings_cross_station", "source_text": "A sign overhead said Hogwarts Express, eleven O\u2019Clock."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e65", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "molly_weasley", "location": "platform_nine_and_three_quarters", "source_text": "\u201cExcuse me,\u201d Harry said to the plump woman."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e66", "type": "help", "agent": "molly_weasley", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "platform_nine_and_three_quarters", "source_text": "\u201cAll you have to do is walk straight at the barrier."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e67", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "hogwarts_express", "source_text": "Harry pushed his cart off down the platform in search of an empty seat."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e68", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "hogwarts_express", "source_text": "\u201cAnyone sitting there?\u201d he asked, pointing at the seat opposite Harry."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e69", "type": "talk", "agent": "ron_weasley", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hogwarts_express", "source_text": "\u201cAre you really Harry Potter?\u201d Ron blurted out."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e70", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "hermione_granger", "location": "hogwarts_express", "source_text": "\u201cHas anyone seen a toad? Neville\u2019s lost one,\u201d she said."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e71", "type": "talk", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hogwarts_express", "source_text": "\u201cI\u2019m Hermione Granger, by the way, who are you."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e72", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "draco_malfoy", "location": "hogwarts_express", "source_text": "\u201cIs it true?\u201d he said. \u201cThey\u2019re saying all down the train that Harry Potter\u2019s in this compartment."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e73", "type": "attack", "agent": "scabbers", "patient": "goyle", "location": "hogwarts_express", "source_text": "Scabbers the rat was hanging off his finger, sharp little teeth sunk deep into Goyle\u2019s knuckle."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e74", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "hogwarts_boat", "source_text": "\u201cNo more\u2019n four to a boat!\u201d Hagrid called."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e75", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "underground_harbor", "source_text": "They were carried along a dark tunnel, which seemed to be taking them right underneath the castle."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e76", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "hogwarts_castle", "source_text": "They walked up a flight of stone steps and crowded around the huge, Oak front door."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e77", "type": "arrive", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": null, "location": "entrance_hall", "source_text": "The door swung open at once."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e78", "type": "talk", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": "first_years", "location": "small_chamber", "source_text": "Welcome to Hogwarts."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e79", "type": "leave", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": null, "location": "small_chamber", "source_text": "She left the chamber."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e80", "type": "arrive", "agent": "ghosts", "patient": null, "location": "small_chamber", "source_text": "About twenty ghosts had just streamed through the back wall."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e81", "type": "arrive", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": null, "location": "small_chamber", "source_text": "Professor McGonagall had returned."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e82", "type": "arrive", "agent": "first_years", "patient": null, "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "They walked out of the chamber, back across the hall, and through a pair of double doors into the Great Hall."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e83", "type": "talk", "agent": "sorting_hat", "patient": "first_years", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "The hat began to sing."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e84", "type": "praise", "agent": "sorting_hat", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "Plenty of courage, I see. Not a bad mind either."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e85", "type": "arrive", "agent": "albus_dumbledore", "patient": null, "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "Albus Dumbledore had gotten to his feet."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e86", "type": "talk", "agent": "albus_dumbledore", "patient": "students", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "Welcome to a new year at Hogwarts!"}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e87", "type": "talk", "agent": "sir_nicholas", "patient": "gryffindor_first_years", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "So \u2014 new Gryffindors! I hope you\u2019re going to help us win the house championship this year?"}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e88", "type": "arrive", "agent": "peeves", "patient": null, "location": "corridor", "source_text": "A loud, rude sound, like the air being let out of a balloon, answered."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e89", "type": "leave", "agent": "peeves", "patient": null, "location": "corridor", "source_text": "Peeves stuck out his tongue and vanished."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e90", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "\u201cWhat have we got today?\u201d Harry asked Ron"}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e91", "type": "talk", "agent": "ron_weasley", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "\u201cDouble Potions with the Slytherins,\u201d said Ron."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e92", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "note_from_hagrid", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "dropped a note onto Harry\u2019s plate."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e93", "type": "talk", "agent": "severus_snape", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "dungeons", "source_text": "\u201cAh, Yes,\u201d he said softly, \u201cHarry Potter. Our new \u2014 celebrity.\u201d"}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e94", "type": "injure", "agent": "neville_longbottom", "patient": null, "location": "dungeons", "source_text": "angry red boils sprang up all over his arms and legs."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e95", "type": "help", "agent": "seamus_finnigan", "patient": "neville_longbottom", "location": "dungeons", "source_text": "\u201cTake him up to the hospital wing,\u201d Snape spat at Seamus."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e96", "type": "talk", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hagrid_house", "source_text": "\u201cMake yerselves at home,\u201d said Hagrid."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e97", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "hagrid_house", "source_text": "It was a cutting from the Daily Prophet: GRINGOTTS BREAKIN LATEST"}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e98", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "remembrall", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "Malfoy\u2019s got my Remembrall, Professor."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e99", "type": "take", "agent": "draco_malfoy", "patient": "remembrall", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "Malfoy, who was passing the Gryffindor table, snatched the Remembrall out of his hand."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e100", "type": "give", "agent": "draco_malfoy", "patient": "remembrall", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "Scowling, Malfoy quickly dropped the Remembrall back on the table."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e101", "type": "injure", "agent": "null", "patient": "neville_longbottom", "location": "grounds", "source_text": "Neville lay facedown on the grass in a heap."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e102", "type": "help", "agent": "madam_hooch", "patient": "neville_longbottom", "location": "grounds", "source_text": "Come on, boy \u2014 it\u2019s all right, up you get."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e103", "type": "take", "agent": "madam_hooch", "patient": "neville_longbottom", "location": "grounds", "source_text": "None of you is to move while I take this boy to the hospital wing!"}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e104", "type": "take", "agent": "draco_malfoy", "patient": "remembrall", "location": "grounds", "source_text": "Look!\u201d said Malfoy, darting forward and snatching something out of the grass."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e105", "type": "give", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "remembrall", "location": "grounds", "source_text": "a foot from the ground he caught it, just in time to pull his broom straight."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e106", "type": "praise", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "castle", "source_text": "Your father would have been proud."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e107", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "oliver_wood", "location": "castle", "source_text": "Potter, this is Oliver Wood."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e108", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "null", "location": "third_floor_corridor", "source_text": "They were looking straight into the eyes of a monstrous dog."}
